├── entity/User.java
├── repo/UserRepository.java
├── service/UserService.java
├── service/JwtService.java
├── filter/JwtAuthFilter.java
├── controller/AuthController.java
└── dto/{RegisterRequest, LoginRequest, AuthResponse}.java
```

## Ключевые связи между компонентами

**1. User (JPA) + роли**
```java
@Entity
@Table(name = "users")
public class User implements UserDetails {
    @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;
    @Column(unique = true, nullable = false)
    private String username;
    private String password;
    @ElementCollection(fetch = FetchType.EAGER)
    @Enumerated(EnumType.STRING)
    private Set<Role> roles;
    // getAuthorities() -> roles.stream().map(r -> new SimpleGrantedAuthority("ROLE_"+r)).toList()
}
```

**2. UserRepository**
```java
public interface UserRepository extends JpaRepository<User, Long> {
    Optional<User> findByUsername(String username);
}
```

**3. UserService — мост между JPA и Security**
```java
@Service
public class UserService implements UserDetailsService {
    private final UserRepository repo;      // Hibernate-слой
    private final PasswordEncoder encoder;  // Security-слой

    @Override
    public UserDetails loadUserByUsername(String username) {
        return repo.findByUsername(username)
            .orElseThrow(() -> new UsernameNotFoundException(username));
    }

    public User register(RegisterRequest r) {
        User u = new User();
        u.setUsername(r.username());
        u.setPassword(encoder.encode(r.password())); // BCrypt
        u.setRoles(Set.of(Role.USER));
        return repo.save(u);
    }
}
```

**4. SecurityConfig — связка**
```java
@Configuration
@EnableWebSecurity
public class SecurityConfig {
    @Bean PasswordEncoder passwordEncoder() { return new BCryptPasswordEncoder(); }

    @Bean
    SecurityFilterChain chain(HttpSecurity http, JwtAuthFilter jwtFilter) throws Exception {
        return http
            .csrf(c -> c.disable())
            .authorizeHttpRequests(a -> a
                .requestMatchers("/auth/register", "/auth/login").permitAll()
                .anyRequest().authenticated())
            .sessionManagement(s -> s.sessionCreationPolicy(STATELESS))
            .authenticationProvider(daoAuthProvider())
            .addFilterBefore(jwtFilter, UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter.class)
            .build();
    }

    @Bean
    DaoAuthenticationProvider daoAuthProvider(UserService userService) {
        var p = new DaoAuthenticationProvider();
        p.setUserDetailsService(userService);     // JPA-репозиторий под капотом
        p.setPasswordEncoder(passwordEncoder());
        return p;
    }
}
```

**5. AuthController**
```java
@PostMapping("/login")
public AuthResponse login(@RequestBody LoginRequest req, AuthenticationManager am) {
    var auth = am.authenticate(new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(req.username(), req.password()));
    return new AuthResponse(jwtService.generate(auth));
}
```
`AuthenticationManager` здесь идёт к `DaoAuthenticationProvider`, тот — к `UserService.loadUserByUsername`, тот — к `UserRepository` (Hibernate/SQL). Это и есть цепочка связки.

## Порядок реализации
1. entities + repo + миграция (Flyway/Liquibase)
2. UserService + PasswordEncoder
3. JwtService + JwtAuthFilter
4. SecurityConfig
5. AuthController + DTO
6. Тесты: регистрация → логин → доступ к защищённому эндпоинту

